                           UCM – Ulva Culture Medium

  Before preparing this medium you must read and sign the UCM
                        Media Prep SSW/RA

Stocks                                                                  per litre
         (1) NaH2PO4.H2O                                                0.7 g
             NaHCO3                                                     8.8 g
             Tris                                                       10.0 g

         Filter sterile.

         (2) KBr                                                        7.84 g
             KCl                                                        54.2 g
             SrCl2.6H2O                                                 1.95 g

         Filter sterile.

         (3) Trace elements (x10 concentration):                        per litre
             Na2EDTA                                                    6.684 g
             H3BO3                                                      11.4 g
             FeSO4.7H2O                                                 1.99 g
             CuSO4.5H2O                                                 0.039 g
             Na2MoO4.2H2O                                               0.126 g
             MnCl2.4H2O                                                 0.36 g
             ZnSO4.7H2O                                                 0.44 g
             Co(NO3)2.6H2O                                              0.033 g
             NH4VO3                                                     0.023 g
             KI                                                         0.039 g
             Na2SeO3.5H2O                                               0.00263g
             As2O3                                                      0.000093 g
             Na2WO4.2H2O                                                0.000066 g
             TeO2                                                       0.000034 g

For ease of measuring, first prepare primary trace element stock solutions:

Primary stock 1                                                         per 100 ml
            Na2SeO3.5H2O                                                2.63 g

Primary stock 2                                                         per 100 ml
            NaOH                                                        4.0 g
            As2O3                                                       0.093 g

Primary stock 3                                                         per 100 ml
            Na2WO4.2H2O                                                 0.066 g

Primary stock 4                                                         per 100 ml
            NaOH                                                        4.0 g
            TeO2                                                        0.034 g


